  "description": "A scan of one of the British Embassy in Cairo's stone lions, found outside the entrance. This was scanned very quickly whilst waiting for colleagues at a reception held for the staff of the Egyptian Museum, Cairo and the @fitzwilliammuseum's team who were working together on the Egyptian coffins project.\n\n72 photographs, Honor 10 mobile phone. Processed in Metashape standard at medium settings.",
